    <string name="streak_stages_text" translatable="false">0 days: logs and cold coals, no fire\n1 day: a small fire\n3 days: a bigger fire\n7 days: bigger again, and the Anime / Manga buttons catch fire\n14 days: more intensity on the icon and the buttons\n30 days: final stage, nothing changes after this\n\nOne missed day per week is forgiven by the grace day. Days run from the hour set above, so late-night sessions still count for the day before.</string>
    <string name="streak_debug" translatable="false">Debug mode</string>
    <string name="streak_debug_info" translatable="false">Changes only what the Home header shows. Your real streak is not touched and keeps counting in the background. Turn debug off to see it again.</string>
